>Do you only enjoy a game if you win?

Not always, but if a game is *too* hard, then one tires of it rather
rapidly.
I agree with the "dissenters", I say that Nethack 3.0 patchlevel n,
is a wee tad too hard.  There aren't enough remove curse spells
floating around, so if you have a couple of items of cursed
armor, weapons, etc, or even a cursed ring of hunger, you've bought
the farm, 'cause dipping in a fountain doesn't work often enough.
  Sure, I can understand the idea of having a challenging game,
  and having to overcome obstacles, but I DESPISE a game that
  takes up a lot of time, and you still get killed off (Crom is
  pleased. -the Giant Mummy hits- -more- the Giant Mummy hits- -more-
  -you die-)
  Still, I do like the game, but I would like it more if it was just
  a little easier.

